{"title":"Yeti Ravager","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 60 Yeti that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (20.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 2 recorded drops, 232 total, 24–208 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×24–208</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"yeti-fang\" title=\"Yeti Fang - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/b964f6987e786c9b807e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Yeti Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-feet\" title=\"Dragonscale Feet - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7ce6de157efd9abd04f5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-3900.4px,772.9px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/14/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/15/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/16/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4096px;top:-768px\"><i style=\"left:3943.4px;top:-725.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:3907.8px;top:-808.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:3850.0px;top:-785.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:3815.8px;top:-765.7px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 428, -991 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 415, -973 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"yeti-ravager\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/graymaw\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/18aad708801ed6539ecc.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Graymaw</b><span>Lv 60</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Yeti: <a href=\"#/monster/snow-yeti\">Snow Yeti</a> <span class=\"muted\">(55)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/yeti\">Yeti</a> <span class=\"muted\">(58)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/yeti-matriarch\">Yeti Matriarch</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/29b34e5550df525f75c8.svg\" alt=\"Yeti Ravager\"></div><h3>Yeti Ravager</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>6